  "index_test_evidence": "We tested this hypothesis by measuring the blocking potencies of 32 torsadogenic (+TdP) and 23 non-torsadogenic (-TdP) drugs on hERG, and the depolarizing Cav1.2 and Nav1.5 channel currents. We used logistic regression models to compare torsadogenic probabilities determined by block of hERG alone or block of hERG coupled with block of Cav1.2 and/or block of Nav1.5.",
  "decision": "exclude",
  "reason": "The study uses in vitro measurements of ion channel block to predict human clinical outcomes. It does not include any whole-animal in vivo studies as the index test."
